                                                "sense_id": "5f6b59ac-faea-3871-9ccf-95eb6c9ae3bc",
                                                "text": "Lord Carington […] led the way with his chestnuts […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5839a25c-fcbf-4444-bd75-4f48f56c2b26",
                                                "sense_id": "5f6b59ac-faea-3871-9ccf-95eb6c9ae3bc",
